{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24629","headline":"寄题余杭郡楼兼呈裴使君 · 白居易","name":"寄题余杭郡楼兼呈裴使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官历二十政，宦游三十秋。\n江山与风月，最忆是杭州。\n北郭沙堤尾，西湖石岸头。\n绿觞春送客，红烛夜回舟。\n不敢言遗爱，空知念旧游。\n凭君吟此句，题向望涛楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}